    "Permanently deletes your Kryptos account and every vault entry, encryption key, and reminder stored on this device. You will be signed out. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permanently deletes your Kryptos account and every vault entry, encryption key, and reminder stored on this device. You will be signed out. This cannot be undone."
